YieldcoinShare_initialize
├── when initialization succeeds
│   ├── it should set the token metadata
│   ├── it should start unpaused
│   ├── it should set the CCIP admin
│   ├── it should set the default admin
│   ├── it should grant PAUSER_ROLE
│   ├── it should grant UNPAUSER_ROLE
│   ├── it should grant CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should grant UPGRADER_ROLE
├── when default admin is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
├── when pauser is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
├── when unpauser is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
├── when config operator is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
├── when initial CCIP admin is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
├── when upgrader is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
├── when already initialized
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
└── when called on the implementation directly
    └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
